  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultant to assist MIGSTAB with programming of 50 mio. DKK to implement the national action plan for Women, Peace and Security. 
With this NAP Denmark commits to strengthen efforts for the full, equal and meaningful participation of women in the work for peace and security. Denmark will promote the participation of local women&#x2019;s organisations in peace and conflict resolution processes through the independent WPS programme.</narrative>
